# Real video/font assets for Third Party designs are fetched on demand
# (see the "Download" button in the lock screen picker) and can be
# regenerated from thirdparty-assets.json at any time, never commit them,
# that's the entire point of the download-on-demand design.
*-assets/

# The wallsflow-sourced designs below have no legitimate re-download URL
# (their CDN blocks scripted access), so their videos are committed
# directly instead of going through the download-on-demand system.
!anime-girl-gtr-assets/
!black-cat-water-assets/
!moonlit-rooftop-cat-assets/
!nissan-350z-night-assets/
!porsche-911-darkness-assets/
!skyline-r34-rain-assets/
!supercar-sakura-assets/
